<h2>逐单差价</h2><div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>到达 / 泊位</th><th>应收</th><th>实收</th><th>差价</th><th>回执</th><th>结论</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in report.settlement.lines %}<tr><td>{{ local(row.arrival) }} · {{ row.berth }}</td><td>{{ yuan(row.due_cents) }}</td><td>{{ yuan(row.paid_cents) }}</td><td class="{{ 'difference' if row.difference_cents else '' }}">{{ yuan(row.difference_cents) }}</td><td>{% for r in row.receipts %}{{ r.fields.receipt }} · 第 {{ r.line }} 行{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}{% else %}—{% endfor %}</td><td>{{ label[row.code] }}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="6">没有可结算停靠。</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<section class="panel pending"><h3>泊位待核与应管</h3><div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>泊位</th><th>应管</th><th>停测申报</th><th>已核实</th><th>他杆补足</th><th>待核</th><th>待核区间</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in report.outages.berths %}<tr><td>{{ row.berth }}</td><td>{{ (report.settlement.berths|selectattr('berth','equalto',row.berth)|map(attribute='scheduled')|list)[0]|default(0) }}</td><td>{{ row.outage_minutes }}</td><td>{{ row.covered_minutes }}</td><td>{{ row.other_pole_minutes }}</td><td class="{{ 'difference' if row.pending_minutes else '' }}">{{ row.pending_minutes }}</td><td>{% for block in row.pending_ranges %}{{ local(block.start) }}–{{ local(block.end)[-5:] }}{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}{% else %}—{% endfor %}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="7">本批没有停测申报，空闲分钟均可结案。</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div><p>待核 {{ report.settlement.pending.total }} 分钟未计入空闲，也未出账；晚到杆侧记录补齐后可更正留档。</p>{% if report.outages.declared %}<div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>申报泊位</th><th>杆侧</th><th>停测区间</th><th>申报分钟</th><th>已核实</th><th>他杆补足</th><th>待核</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in report.outages.declared %}<tr><td>{{ row.berth }}</td><td>{{ row.sensor or '整泊位' }}</td><td>{{ local(row.start) }}–{{ local(row.end)[-5:] }}</td><td>{{ row.declared_minutes }}</td><td>{{ row.covered_minutes }}</td><td>{{ row.other_pole_minutes }}</td><td>{{ row.pending_minutes }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>{% endif %}</section>
{% if report.amendment %}<section class="panel amendment"><h3>本次更正 · 原留档 <code>{{ report.amendment.parent[:14] }}</code></h3><div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>泊位</th><th>待核 前 → 后</th><th>空闲 前 → 后</th><th>争议 前 → 后</th><th>出账分钟 前 → 后</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in report.amendment.berths %}<tr><td>{{ row.berth }}</td><td>{{ row.pending_before }} → {{ row.pending_after }}</td><td>{{ row.vacant_before }} → {{ row.vacant_after }}</td><td>{{ row.disputed_before }} → {{ row.disputed_after }}</td><td>{{ row.free_before+row.base_before+row.upgrade_before }} → {{ row.free_after+row.base_after+row.upgrade_after }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div><p>待核 {{ report.amendment.pending_before }} → {{ report.amendment.pending_after }} 分钟，应收 {{ yuan(report.amendment.due_before) }} → {{ yuan(report.amendment.due_after) }}。原留档编号不变，同一批重跑不新增留档。</p></section>{% endif %}
<section class="panel exceptions"><h3>游离实收</h3>{% for row in report.settlement.orphans %}<p>回执 {{ row.fields.receipt }} · 第 {{ row.line }} 行 · {{ yuan(row.cents) }}</p>{% else %}<p>无游离回执。</p>{% endfor %}</section>{% if report.settlement.isolated %}{% set issues=report.settlement.isolated %}{% include 'issues.j2' %}{% endif %}
